## Quality gate

- **Behavior changed** — a business rule, a contract, what the user sees — **then a test is
  written or updated**, covering the exact boundary from both sides.
- **Run `{{TEST_COMMAND}}` at the end of every task and report the real output.** Never
  claim done without it.
- **If it has a screen, launch it and look.** A green suite proves what you thought to
  assert. If you cannot launch it, render the changed screens at 320 and 360 logical pixels
  instead, and say the visual result is unverified.
- No coverage targets.

